<mxCell id="access" value="Memory access: X read / write&lt;br&gt;position P and read-slot E reads" style="html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;fontFamily=Helvetica;fontSize=16;fillColor=#ffffff;strokeColor=#1678be;fontColor=#1678be;strokeWidth=2;rounded=0;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="605" y="475" width="620" height="65" as="geometry"/></mxCell>
<mxCell id="note" value="For each feature: read e → add position P → convert → add read-slot E → convert → write X in the same location.&lt;br&gt;P and E are trained values. Process all L = M × N tokens, including padded ones. One addition block is used twice.&lt;br&gt;Input/output arrows show stored data flow, not a direct live link. Stage 3 waits for all writes. FSM: Stage 2 detail 4; errors: Stage 2 detail 7." style="html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;fontFamily=Helvetica;fontSize=16;fillColor=#ffffff;strokeColor=#374151;fontColor=#374151;strokeWidth=2;rounded=0;strokeColor=none;fillColor=none;fontColor=#263442;fontSize=15;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="30" y="615" width="1440" height="85" as="geometry"/></mxCell>
