<mxCell id="note" value="LN1 stores all U before attention. First residual stores all R before LN2. LN2 stores all V before FFN/residual 2 token loop.&lt;br&gt;LN1: X→U; LN2: X(R)→U(V). Residual 1 writes X=R; residual 2 writes X=next layer output.&lt;br&gt;A Read / Write state uses the shared transaction FSM. A Run state waits for child completion. Stalls never advance an index." style="html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;fontFamily=Helvetica;fontSize=16;fillColor=#ffffff;strokeColor=#374151;fontColor=#374151;strokeWidth=2;rounded=0;strokeColor=none;fillColor=none;fontColor=#263442;fontSize=15;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="30" y="615" width="1440" height="85" as="geometry"/></mxCell>
