<mxCell id="note" value="Repeat L D→D linear commands for Q, then K, then V. Next projection resets t and selects distinct weights/biases.&lt;br&gt;Output projection uses the same token-loop controller with WO/bO and Z→O; it is not a fourth Q/K/V pass.&lt;br&gt;A Read / Write state uses the shared transaction FSM. A Run state waits for child completion. Stalls never advance an index." style="html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;fontFamily=Helvetica;fontSize=16;fillColor=#ffffff;strokeColor=#374151;fontColor=#374151;strokeWidth=2;rounded=0;strokeColor=none;fillColor=none;fontColor=#263442;fontSize=15;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="30" y="615" width="1440" height="85" as="geometry"/></mxCell>
