<mxCell id="note" value="s[h,i,j] = QScore(Σᵣ Q[i,h·d+r] K[j,h·d+r] × c), with c = stored 1/√d.&lt;br&gt;Dot uses two contiguous d-element slices, initial sum zero. Scale uses a scalar multiplier, not a runtime square root.&lt;br&gt;Loop keys j=0..L−1 for one head h and query i. Keep wide score format; do not narrow to ACT." style="html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;fontFamily=Helvetica;fontSize=16;fillColor=#ffffff;strokeColor=#374151;fontColor=#374151;strokeWidth=2;rounded=0;strokeColor=none;fillColor=none;fontColor=#263442;fontSize=15;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="30" y="615" width="1440" height="85" as="geometry"/></mxCell>
