<mxCell id="access" value="Memory access: score row / saved exponentials / probability row / query mask / 1/L constant" style="html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;fontFamily=Helvetica;fontSize=16;fillColor=#ffffff;strokeColor=#1678be;fontColor=#1678be;strokeWidth=2;rounded=0;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="260" y="480" width="950" height="65" as="geometry"/></mxCell>
<mxCell id="note" value="Normal row: vmax = max(s[j]); b[j] = EXP(s[j]−vmax); T = Σ b[j]; p[j] = QPROB(b[j] × RECIP(T)).&lt;br&gt;Maximum starts from the first score, not zero. Padded query: p[j] = stored 1/L instead; no exp / reciprocal work.&lt;br&gt;EXP and RECIP remain black boxes until range, method and error targets are chosen. T must be positive." style="html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;fontFamily=Helvetica;fontSize=16;fillColor=#ffffff;strokeColor=#374151;fontColor=#374151;strokeWidth=2;rounded=0;strokeColor=none;fillColor=none;fontColor=#263442;fontSize=15;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="30" y="615" width="1440" height="85" as="geometry"/></mxCell>
