<mxCell id="note" value="Store all 4D linear-1 values, then overwrite each A location with its GELU result after reading it.&lt;br&gt;Only after all 4D GELU writes finish, start linear 2 into a separate D-result scratch. Both linear commands own their writes.&lt;br&gt;A Read / Write state uses the shared transaction FSM. A Run state waits for child completion. Stalls never advance an index." style="html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;fontFamily=Helvetica;fontSize=16;fillColor=#ffffff;strokeColor=#374151;fontColor=#374151;strokeWidth=2;rounded=0;strokeColor=none;fillColor=none;fontColor=#263442;fontSize=15;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="30" y="615" width="1440" height="85" as="geometry"/></mxCell>
