<mxCell id="note" value="Response is accepted only in Wait response. Keep result/error stable in Done until the caller accepts it.&lt;br&gt;Fatal errors stop new requests and drain accepted work; no timeout is assumed. Reset clears all pending interfaces.&lt;br&gt;A Read / Write state uses the shared transaction FSM. A Run state waits for child completion. Stalls never advance an index." style="html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;fontFamily=Helvetica;fontSize=16;fillColor=#ffffff;strokeColor=#374151;fontColor=#374151;strokeWidth=2;rounded=0;strokeColor=none;fillColor=none;fontColor=#263442;fontSize=15;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="30" y="615" width="1440" height="85" as="geometry"/></mxCell>
